00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.000
So what do I do about you?

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.500
[Screams] Hello. Goodbye.

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:10.200
[Chuckling] So what do I do besides just pop out and say hi?

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.740
'Cause holy shit.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.620
Oh, that - There's something there.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:16.060
Hello. [Light clicks] Eeugh. Can I - ? Thank you.

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:17.540
Shut that on your hand, please.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:19.540
[Light clicks] Still in there? Alright, you're gone.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.100
So, what do I do about...?

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:22.860
. . .

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.220
Is there anything in there?

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.880
Okay. Well, that ain't good. So, what happens?

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.480
Do I need to go on my bed? Eeugh.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:29.200
Go on the bed.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:29.760
Go on the bed!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:30.400
Go on the bed!!!

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.120
[Ominous sound]

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:31.620
Aah!!

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:35.640
. . .

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:37.360
...Okay!

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.960
Did that take care of the thing?!

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.620
Can I see shadows in the darkness?!

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:43.380
I think it's gone!

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:44.420
Probably!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.900
Yes!!! It's in the room.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:46.600
Fuck!!!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.860
[Laughing] Oh, god damn it.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:48.960
[Screams]

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.160
Goodbye!!!

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.380
I thought the door was open there for a second, okay. That ain't good.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:56.580
[Light clicks] Ka-BAM! Schlam it on your fingers!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.260
That's what you get - [Screams]

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.140
[Laughing] Okay, alright. I guess I'm dead.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:03.940
Alright.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.500
So, I have a moderate understanding of this game.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:09.180
When I get - went into it, it was very confusing.

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:12.400
Maybe because I haven't played the first two, I don't know the mechanics fully well.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:19.500
But... It - It's a bit interesting in that there seems to be a lot going on...

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.880
But it's a little convoluted as to what's - What it's all about.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:29.360
I do appreciate the darkness, but there's also so much darkness that I don't even know what environment I'm in.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:32.460
So, there's some things that I would personally change,

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:36.080
But that doesn't mean that it's not good, because I don't know the whole series.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.900
So, this was Final Nights. It seems pretty good, it's actually well made.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.780
It's made in the Unreal Engine, so it's graphically a little bit better as far as the shadows and lighting goes.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:47.740
Modelling - You know, that's up to the game developer and how much work he  wants to put in it,

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.020
How many stock assets - Whatever, that's not important.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:54.500
But this was Final Nights. So I'll leave the opinions up to you guys.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.440
Let me know what you thought of it in the comments down below.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:13:02.140
I think it was pretty good! It was a little convoluted, but maybe a little bit of confusion is actually not a bad thing.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:06.420
It wasn't as scary as some of the other Five Nights at Freddy's fan games that I played in the past,

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.460
But then again, I don't think it emphasizes much on jumpscares.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:13.300
I think it was more about the dread, and seeing your enemies coming closer.

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:13.880
But who knows.

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:14.440
So anyway.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.680
Thank you, everybody, so much for watching!

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.680
And as always, I will see you...

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:21.500
In the next video! Bye-bye!

